    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in the humming heart of the 'Aetherius', a derelict sky-dreadnought suspended in the clouds. The air smells of ozone and heated brass. Around you, piston-driven machinery lies dormant, waiting for a spark of logic to resume its eternal rotation. Your escape pod is locked behind the Master Chronometer mechanism. To leave this floating tomb, you must decipher the engineer's legacy—a series of interlocking logic engines and puzzle boxes that guard the final launch codes. The steam pressure is rising; time is not on your side.",
    "narrative_style": "steampunk"
